meta {
  name: Get Locality Details
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/external/open/postcode/details
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

docs {
  Use this API to get further locality details of any given postcode.
  Just pass the valid locality Pincode, and the details will be displayed in JSON format.

  ##### Parameters:

  | **PARAMS** | **REQUIRED** | **DATA TYPE** | **DESCRIPTION** | **EXAMPLE** |
  |---|---|---|---|---|
  | `postcode` | YES | _integer_ | The Pincode you want to get the locality details. | 110077 |
}
